  <h2>The Blueprint for Sustainable Activewear</h2>
  <p>Developing <strong>custom recycled polyester yoga wear</strong> is one of the most effective ways for a brand to demonstrate its commitment to sustainability without sacrificing performance.</p>
  
  <h3>Performance Meets Eco-Friendly</h3>
  <p>Modern recycled polyester, often made from GRS-certified post-consumer plastic, offers the same stretch, recovery, and durability as virgin polyester. It is perfectly suited for high-intensity yoga and gym wear.</p>
  
  <h3>Customization Options</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Custom Prints:</strong> Sublimation printing works perfectly on recycled polyester, allowing for vibrant, eco-friendly designs.</li>
    <li><strong>Fabric Blends:</strong> Blend recycled polyester with spandex for the perfect balance of support and flexibility.</li>
    <li><strong>Eco-Packaging:</strong> Complete the sustainable story with recycled polybags and soy-ink printed tags.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>At Fitclo, we help brands create custom recycled collections that look good, perform better, and do right by the planet.</p>
